'''Fire Bear''' is a [[:Category:Godly|godly]] pet that can be obtained by hatching it from the [[Common Egg|common egg]] or by trading.

== Appearance ==
The Fire Bear has the same design as the [[Bear]], but its whole body is bright red with a fire trail leading behind it.
== Trivia ==

*This item is the non-chroma version of [[Chroma Fire Bear]] and the fire version of [[Bear]]. 

